WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.191 --> 00:00:01.144
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

2
00:00:01.546 --> 00:00:04.913
was / were and could

3
00:00:06.819 --> 00:00:10.229
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Gordon <b>was</b> Jeremy’s business partner.

4
00:00:11.224 --> 00:00:13.554
They <b>were</b> at his country house.

5
00:00:14.909 --> 00:00:17.662
They <b>could</b> hear a strange noise.

6
00:00:19.293 --> 00:00:21.665
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> She <b>wasn’t</b> at home last night.

7
00:00:22.491 --> 00:00:24.566
You <b>weren’t</b> very nice to her.

8
00:00:25.286 --> 00:00:26.684
I <b>couldn’t</b> sleep.

9
00:00:28.505 --> 00:00:33.397
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> <b>Were</b> you ill yesterday? When <b>was</b> he born?

10
00:00:34.498 --> 00:00:37.336
<b>Could</b> you see anybody in the library?

11
00:00:40.195 --> 00:00:41.233
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

12
00:00:41.614 --> 00:00:43.351
regular verbs

13
00:00:44.155 --> 00:00:50.043
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I really <b>liked</b> the present. She <b>wanted</b> to be a doctor.

14
00:00:51.737 --> 00:00:57.603
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> She <b>didn’t enjoy</b> the concert. They <b>didn’t arrive</b> until very late.

15
00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:05.143
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> <b>Did</b> you <b>watch</b> the match last night? When <b>did</b> you <b>finish</b> the book?

16
00:01:07.663 --> 00:01:08.785
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

17
00:01:09.103 --> 00:01:11.030
irregular verbs

18
00:01:11.962 --> 00:01:17.426
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> I <b>went</b> to Paris last summer. She <b>slept</b> on the sofa.

19
00:01:19.035 --> 00:01:24.202
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> He <b>didn’t come</b> home last night. They <b>didn’t hear</b> the music.

20
00:01:25.643 --> 00:01:31.466
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> <b>Did</b> you <b>speak</b> to your sister yesterday? Where <b>did</b> you have lunch?